# IsaFlow

Next.js 14 + TypeScript multi-tenant accounting SaaS for South African businesses. Every DB query is scoped by `company_id`. Deployed to `app.isaflow.co.za`.

## Stack
- Next.js 14 (Pages Router) · TypeScript strict · React 19 · Tailwind · Vitest 4 · Playwright
- Postgres on self-hosted Supabase (Velocity server). `@/lib/neon` is a legacy import path; runtime is pg-backed, NOT Neon Serverless.
- Auth: GoTrue (Supabase Auth). `withAuth` middleware sets user + company + transaction GUCs.
- Package manager: `bun@1.3.2`. Node `>=20.12.0`.

## Layout
```
src/
├── modules/
│   ├── accounting/   # AR, AP, banking, GL, reporting, assets, VAT, payroll, AFS
│   ├── admin/        # Platform admin
│   ├── analytics/
│   ├── auth/         # GoTrue MFA
│   ├── billing/      # PAYG Flow wallet, Stitch Express, subscription billing
│   ├── bureau/
│   └── onboarding/   # SA address + CIPC normalisers (pure)
├── lib/              # neon, logger, apiResponse, auth
└── components/       # AppLayout, accountingNavConfig
pages/{api,accounting}/
scripts/migrations/sql/  # 260+ migrations (latest: 478)
tests/{unit,e2e}/
```

